{"type":"message","id":"0e242635","parentId":"a21d346b","timestamp":"2026-02-12T16:12:21.185Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### Feature Implementation Complete\n\nThe `MetaDescriptionAnalyzer` class has been implemented with the following methods:\n1. **`analyze_length`**: Validates the meta description length against the 50–160 character guideline.\n2. **`analyze_keywords`**: Identifies the presence of target keywords in the description.\n3. **`analyze_engagement`**: Assesses if the meta description is engaging (using placeholder logic for simplicity).\n4. **`detect_duplicates_and_missing`**: Detects duplicate or missing meta descriptions.\n\n---\n\nNext, I'll run the test suite to validate that the implementation is complete and works correctly."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_YrMlFl5UflgzlJDxofWh7nGp","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python -m unittest discover -s tests -p \"test_meta_description_ai.py\"","pty":true}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"github-copilot","model":"gpt-4o","usage":{"input":166,"output":166,"cacheRead":7424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":7756,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770912739030}}
